  },
  {
   "x": 1034,
   "y": 118,
   "text": "scanned test sheet · 200 dpi",
   "size": 22,
   "font": "mono"
  },
  {
   "x": 110,
   "y": 280,
   "text": "The render pool keeps a priority queue. Pages that",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 110,
   "y": 320,
   "text": "are visible on screen are rendered before pages",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 110,
   "y": 360,
   "text": "that are merely close by, and cached tiles are",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 110,
   "y": 400,
   "text": "reused until the memory budget is exceeded.",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 110,
   "y": 464,
   "text": "Selection follows the text layer, not the painted",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 110,
   "y": 504,
   "text": "pixels. Dragging across a line selects real",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 110,
   "y": 544,
   "text": "characters, and copying preserves reading order",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 110,
   "y": 584,
   "text": "even when the page has been rotated or zoomed.",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 110,
   "y": 648,
   "text": "Search accepts words, exact phrases and regular",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 110,
   "y": 688,
   "text": "expressions. Matches are highlighted in the page",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 110,
   "y": 728,
   "text": "and listed in the sidebar so the user can jump",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 110,
   "y": 768,
   "text": "between them without losing the reading position.",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 837,
   "y": 280,
   "text": "Thumbnails are produced by the same render pool",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 837,
   "y": 320,
   "text": "at a lower resolution. They are always generated",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 837,
   "y": 360,
   "text": "after the visible page, which keeps the first paint",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 837,
   "y": 400,
   "text": "fast on documents with hundreds of pages.",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 837,
   "y": 464,
   "text": "The outline is read from the PDF bookmarks and",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 837,
   "y": 504,
   "text": "shown as a tree. Documents with five heading",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 837,
   "y": 544,
   "text": "levels remain navigable because each level can be",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
  {
   "x": 837,
   "y": 584,
   "text": "collapsed independently.",
   "size": 27,
   "font": "body"
  },
